  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionOfSignificantTransactionsNotRequiringUseOfCashOrCashEquivalentsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;"&gt;　２  重要な非資金取引の内容&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;重要な資産除去債務の計上額は、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:left;margin-left:30.1pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="align_left" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:437.7pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:145.7pt;min-width:145.7pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:146pt;min-width:146pt;"/&gt;
